<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/de7bfdb26d01> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "the new report cites six unnamed Israeli intelligence officers who spoke with +972 about how the country’s military “almost completely relied” on Lavender during the early weeks of the war, despite the fact that it was known to misidentify potential targets as terrorists." ;
