<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/f0b875c0cd04> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "In it, the author — a man who we confirmed to be the current commander of the elite Israeli intelligence unit 8200 — makes the case for designing a special machine that could rapidly process massive amounts of data to generate thousands of potential “targets” for military strikes in the heat of a war." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "7570" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/f93337c7d333> a airo:Evidence ;
